1. Direct call denied.
2. Denied in a preprocessor.
3. Denied in a postprocessor.
4. Denied when nested under a String result.
5. Denied via ALTER ADD INDEX.
6. Unprivileged expression unaffected.
1
7. Accepted with the privilege, so not a blocklist.
1
8. Existing index stays readable without the privilege.
1
9. Unrelated ALTER does not re-authorize.
1
10. Neither does DETACH/ATTACH.
1
11. An ALIAS column hiding a privileged function is denied.
12. So is an alias renamed by an earlier command of the same ALTER.
13. Redeclaring with a privileged function is denied.
